// v76: each CotSC civilian now manages its own nighttime removal via QC75NITE.
// Area script remains responsible solely for its original daytime spawn positions.

// Additional Elven Commoner in BG3303, standing, facing west.
// No coordinate was specified; placed in an open-looking interior position near the existing rooms.
IF
  TimeGT(5)
  TimeLT(18)
  !Exists("BIBELF02")
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    CreateCreature("BIBELF02",[700.250],4)
END
